{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forsaken Manor is an exhilarating horror game where you must explore an abandoned and grim house filled with secrets and dangers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to find all the key items hidden in the dark corners of this sinister place to unveil its dark secrets and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an atmosphere of mounting fear, where every decision you make could be crucial. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through twisted hallways, explore forsaken rooms, and encounter paranormal phenomena lurking around every corner. Staying alert and thinking strategically will be your only chance to escape this eerie house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive Atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intricate Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forsaken Manor is your opportunity to embark on a quest to unravel the mysteries of the forsaken house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show courage and ingenuity to uncover its secrets and evade the horrors that linger in the air!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721570?t=1749657502","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721570?t=1749657502","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721570/58dda545a38a7d9e95786bccc6338aa09218a541/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749657502","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721570/58dda545a38a7d9e95786bccc6338aa09218a541/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749657502","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forsaken Manor is an exhilarating horror game where you must explore an abandoned an